    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ccb658651f6053bbf70256",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第二天早上、在还空无一人的学园里――\n在定下训练员契约的那个“约定之地”、\n我再次与迷人景致面对面。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a65679b5c511823cf3deba9df902d91149d7bfe4d40019a21e6ec97ef71702b9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
