    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d8a5142e9e578f51abe048e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她已经宣誓要穷尽生涯奔跑到底。\n那么作为训练员……\n我也要让她看到自己献上一切的觉悟。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88545212eabab7628bdf69a70630a859e4f87f25ba3b872348f088cf03d1a1a4",
